{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_gravel_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_gravel_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "夢中過往",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_gravel_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4faf97741f235db675519536821e1f5639fa87ac84298f0af2598079339fc2ea",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "gravel"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恐怖馬丁酒吧\n（叮鈴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歡迎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "救......救命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別跑！抓住她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我可憐的大門......前天可才剛修好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "騎士、騎士大人......救命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，你以為這裡有能救你的騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看清楚了，只不過是家打著騎士幌子的破酒吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再說，騎士也壓根不會理睬你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拜託誰救救我，我不想......我不想被賣掉......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這可由不得你。客人們，你們聽聽，一個已經被明碼標價的“商品”想要逃走，還想要尋求騎士的幫忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你大可在這繼續大叫，看看有誰會救你！跟我走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我......我是被騙的，我根本不是什麼“商品”！我才不要來卡西米爾，我要回家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，一個不知名村子裡的傻姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過是被個故事騙了，說什麼也想要到卡瓦萊利亞基當騎士，然後就跟傻瓜似的老實跟著來了......可笑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正好，服務員，給我來杯酒，喝完我再把這小妞帶回去，賣給騎士老爺當個家僕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，客人。我們這不太歡迎做地下勾當的獵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說沒有騎士會光臨，這句話也是小瞧了我們店。畢竟，這裡剛好可還坐著大名鼎鼎的“鏽銅騎士”英格拉大人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鏽、鏽銅......你是說，那個鏽銅騎士......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（啊？等等，老闆，我只是剛好來喝酒，這身裝備只是周邊......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（瞪眼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（好，好吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“嗝......咳，吵死了。區區一個骯髒的賞金獵人就來煩我？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“滾出去。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呿......聽到沒，不要讓騎士老爺掃興，和我出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*卡西米爾粗口*，就沒有哪位客人能幫忙把這不守規矩的傢伙請出去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不要......我不要跟你走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚嗚，我不想做別人的家僕，我只想回家......啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*卡西米爾粗口*怎麼還不走，給我出去......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰......咳、咳啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "好吵啊~這裡在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*卡西米爾粗口*，你這個偷襲的傢伙......呃......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "就這點身手，也敢在卡瓦萊利亞基囂張嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......還好有人相救。要不然，自己動手可是難免會為了店裡的東西手下留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經......解決了？過，過了把騎士癮還不錯啊，哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "什麼嘛，卡瓦萊利亞基這麼快就把我忘記了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "馬丁，以前我可沒少來過這吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個身手......還有你的手臂上......是“條碼”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我想起來了，是你啊，“礫”，你是五月樹家族的騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礫......騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "叫我礫就好。這是我的稱呼，可不是什麼死板的名號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "騎士？哼，一個騎士竟然從背後偷襲對手，還用著暗殺者的小伎倆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真正的騎士就應該像英格拉大人一樣，擁有強大的力量，無法被壓制的暴力，只需聽到名字便讓人聞風喪膽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "真是不好意思，客人，和競技場裡用金錢養出來的那些大明星不一樣，我的手段，可都是正經的生存之道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是看不起競技騎士？哼，你們征戰騎士只會用納稅人的錢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這老獵人一時半會兒醒不來了，小姑娘，你自己找機會逃出去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，剛才的見義勇為，還沒向礫道謝呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝，謝謝您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來，您就是礫小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "嗯？我可沒有那麼出名吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，我聽說過您，您來過我們的村子！我們的村子附近有很多賞金獵人，而且太遠了，很少會有騎士老爺來這裡幫我們趕走他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "過去的事情嗎......為了尋找線索，我去過不少地方。不過，這些都是好多年前的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "以你看上去的年紀，根本不會在那時候遇到我......你，是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她還在受驚嚇的狀態，別嚇著人了。讓她冷靜一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礫。好久不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "好久不見，馬丁。最近老爺子有經常來這嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，他本來就很少來這種人多的地方。從上次聽說垂釣的時候掉進湖裡摔著了腿以後，就很久沒來店裡點幾份小菜嘗嘗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "正好，老爺子沒吃的菜就讓我來嘗嘗吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不請小姑娘吃一點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "我是她的救命恩人，怎麼還要請人吃飯啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礫，礫小姐，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "嗯......算了，你先坐到我這邊。馬丁，上兩份菜吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝您，騎士大人......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以說，你這次回來是為了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "只是度假而已，來看看掉了水的老爺子身體如何，過兩天就得回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回去？回哪裡去？你就是卡西米爾的騎士，之後肯定是回自己家族長騎的住處啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "嗯？可是，我已經離開卡西米爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要去哪裡，去做什麼，想成為什麼人是你的自由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要你堅信，你的決定並不會讓你過去的努力白費，也不會玷污了自己的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你就去吧，礫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......是啊，明明我已經告訴過老爺子自己的決定，還和馬丁也道別過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "你這健忘的老闆，馬上就把我的事情給忘記了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，年紀大了，難免記不得那麼多事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "（......不對。馬丁的反應......有些奇怪。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "（發生了那麼重要的事情，他竟然會忘記了......？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礫小姐，你說的“老爺子”是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可是位大人物，五月樹家族的長騎蓋克斯基，是過去大名鼎鼎的征戰騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "五月樹家族當年的付出，可不是現在這些年輕騎士擔得起的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，不過，已經是個老東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我向被冒犯的您的家族和長騎道歉，騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "下一次，可沒有道歉的機會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士粉絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......嘖。老闆，結帳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礫小姐，那位五月樹家族的騎士，是您......很尊敬的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "嗯，當然了。托老爺子的福，我沒有像其它“商品”那樣被限制做那些最底層的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "老爺子給了我去參加訓練的機會，我才有了成為騎士的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真好啊......能有成為騎士的機會。如果，我也能成為騎士的話，就能回去見到爸爸媽媽了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "你已經被刻上商品編號了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，我還沒有......我是中途逃出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "勇氣可嘉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礫騎士，您幫了我，會給您帶來麻煩嗎？我，我知道獵人們不好惹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "沒關係。這種骯髒的交易早該消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "（不，實際上，應該已經徹底消失了才對。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "（......先靜觀其變吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "這個賞金獵人已經不敢再動你，你現在也不是“商品”，不會有人阻攔，趕快回家吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......可是我回不去了啊，礫小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒有錢，而且，我不知道自己的家在哪裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "你的家不就在卡西米爾嗎？只要報上村子的名字......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，我不是卡西米爾人......在很小的時候，我就已經被拐到卡西米爾的村莊來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回家？好啊，你的家在哪裡？是卡西米爾的哪個村莊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "不......不在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......我......不是卡西米爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "那小姑娘，你到底來自哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......我......不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "全部都忘記了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，我想要逃跑，但是已經忘記自己來自哪裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到有獵人告訴我，他會帶我去找騎士，騎士會帶我回家，運氣好的話我也會成為騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就......被帶到了卡瓦萊利亞基。後來我才知道，他們想把我賣掉，讓我去侍奉他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是我不想做這些！我想要回家，我是聽說他可以帶我尋找騎士，帶我回家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從這裡自己離開卡西米爾，去找到自己的家鄉見到父母，對一個年幼的孩子來說根本不可能發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "嘖。我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "（我當然知道。這件事......我再清楚不過了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礫小姐，您的手臂上的......是“條碼”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道說，您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......嗯，是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "和你不同，我甚至沒有從獵人手上逃走的機會，就這樣被賣掉了。唯一幸運的是，買走我的老爺子是位大善人，毫無疑問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，能成為騎士完全是靠礫你自己的努力。從平民成為征戰騎士，是不會有人不知道其中的艱難的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好厲害，竟然能夠成為騎士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，在礫小姐您成為了騎士之後，有回到自己的家鄉，見到自己的父母嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我好想他們，好想再見到一次爸爸媽媽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "我沒有找到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "我去過你待過的村子，或許是因為我想尋找那些獵人的蹤跡，想知道他們從哪裡把我帶走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "但是......我沒有找到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "不對，這些不是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礫......騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "不要再把我拖進回憶的旋渦了。這些是......一直以來，我最害怕發生的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "如果沒有遇到老爺子，如果沒有成為騎士，如果一直找不到家人......我會面臨什麼樣的境地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "但是，我早就知道，這些已經不再會是我的心魔了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礫，你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "還有馬丁，你也是。你不會不知道我已經離開卡西米爾，加入了羅德島......沒錯，我是從“羅德島”回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......我知道，看你的眼神就能明白。你是來向我道別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "我......要去羅德島。跟隨那個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "哼。你已經告訴他你的名字了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "還沒有。我需要親眼再確認一次，那個人到底有沒有欺騙我，想要利用我施行作惡的計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "那你就去吧。去那個羅德島上看看，順便繼續去找到你的故鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "我知道，你沒有放棄去找它。這是正確的事情，礫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "老爺子，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "停。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "就和當年所說的一樣，礫。去吧，你遲早是要離開的。既然這一次下定決心，就沒什麼好眷戀的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓋克斯基",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "想回來看看的時候就回卡西米爾來，不想回來......就不要有負擔，走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“羅德島”？礫，你是五月樹家族的家臣，是四階騎士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "這已經是......過去的事了，馬丁。現在的我，屬於羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "這個女孩剛才說的，這些都是“我”的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "是我沒有被騎士拯救，被拐到卡西米爾來，賣到了卡瓦萊利亞基......而我卻連回家的路都不知道怎麼走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃跑的女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_004",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，礫小姐，您在卡西米爾也有了自己的家族呀。作為五月樹家族的家臣，作為一名騎士，您一定非常幸福......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "我是老爺子的家臣，對老爺子有永遠的尊敬和感激。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "但是，老爺子最終對我說......我不該永遠眷戀這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "我要離開卡西米爾，是因為有了必須離開的理由，以及到了去尋找自己真正的家鄉和父母的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "是的......這一切不過是在夢裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "要說為什麼，因為現在已經不會再有被拐來卡瓦萊利亞基的小孩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
      "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
      "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
      "text": "那些殘忍的，包裹著“賞金獵人”的皮的惡人，做著販賣勾當的最後的勢力，早在當年我沿著每個村莊巡歷並懲治獵人的時候，就已經被——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "礫。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "......呼......呃。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "（這裡是......羅德島？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "礫。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "是，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "（果然，剛才的一切都是在夢裡。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "（一次又一次地做著相似的夢，只不過......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "抱歉，我竟然......睡著了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "沒事吧，你的表情不是非常安穩。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "呼呼，您是在擔心我嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "真是難得，平常都是我盯著您看，沒想到也會有被注視的時候。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "只是關心一下。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不是那種意思，你別介意......",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "我明白，博士工作的時候可不會分心。只是監督我這個護衛有沒有好好工作，是吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "啊~總之，不用在意我，還請繼續努力工作吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "其實礫......累了的話，睡一覺也沒關係的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "嗯？這樣不算我的失職嗎，博士~"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不算。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "沒什麼大不了的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "......真狡猾啊，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "在卡西米爾的時候，難得有睡著的時間，會經常做些夢......雖然不是什麼好夢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "博士，您在失去記憶之後......會感到無措和驚慌嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "嗯。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "我時常做夢。夢到自己離開家鄉，被帶到了卡西米爾。我找各種各樣的人尋求幫助，甚至找到夢中的“我”，希望他們能夠幫助我回家。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "可是，每次被人問到我的家鄉在哪裡，我卻......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "時至今日，我還是無法想起自己到底來自哪裡。只記得那是個和卡西米爾完全不一樣的地方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "貧窮，閉塞......脆弱。做父母的連保護自己的孩子也做不到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "但不論如何，這麼多年來，我始終想要找到我的家鄉，回去見我的父母一面。不知道他們是否安好，還會不會記得我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "我多麼幸運啊，能夠被老爺子撿到，能夠有不同於其他“商品”的命運，得到了可以靠自己的努力擁有騎士身份的機會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "但是，我沒有忘記，我成為騎士的理由是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "為了有找尋自己的力量，為了有保護他人的能力。然後現在，我有了......保護您性命安全的使命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "咳咳。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "啊~您這是害羞了嗎？沒事的，博士，我不會去猜測您的想法。我現在，只想用自己這雙眼睛好好看著您的舉動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "只要您給我這個機會，能夠讓我時刻在您身邊守衛著您，這樣就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "好了，快點回到工作中去吧，博士~還是說，您其實特別想知道我的事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（點頭）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（猛地搖頭）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "沒關係，博士，我會陪伴您很長的時間。在您想知道的時候，我會把我的過去都告訴您。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "離開卡西米爾，來到羅德島，我便擁有了更加自由的身份，也能夠繼續追尋家鄉的線索。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "現在......這樣安靜的相處，就是最能讓我冷靜的了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "不過嘛......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "（博士的辦公室，竟然已經變成了能讓我睡得著覺的房間嗎......這算是一點小特權？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
          "operatorId": "char_237_gravel",
          "portraitKey": "char_237_gravel",
          "text": "（對了，下次邀請博士一起回卡西米爾看看吧。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerToken": "char_237_gravel",
